0.5
===
- Update from mainstream binutils snapshot 2005-02-26

0.4.1
=====
- corrected bugs: 
  [ 824937 ] bftsth #xxxx,X:xxxx opcode generated incorrectly
  [ 836842 ] brclr and bftsth opcodes generated incorrectly
  [ 836851 ] non-multiply insn x:xxxx,fff generated incorrectly
- read more in binutils_20030920_dsp56800_0.4.1.patch.README

0.4
===
- corrected bug: [ 819655 ] cmp #,FDD generated incorrectly
- corrected generation of following insns: lsll, tstw, add, cpm, move
- made clean up in the port
- finished gas,ld and binutils testsuites (now it's possible to use
   make check in gas,ld and binutils directories, however not in
   bfd directory)
- read more in binutils_20030920_dsp56800_0.4.patch.README

0.3
===
- This version is merge to mainstream binutils snapshot 2003-09-20. 
    It is released as a patch. Meant as a preparation for adding this port
    to official CVS.
- Corrected bug: [ 801029 ] bfclr #const,x:addr fails with const > 0x8000
- All other thing remain as they were in v0.2
- read more in binutils_20030920_dsp56800.patch.README